error[R0611] (conservative): `\U` is not an escape sequence
--> 10:17: Luau drops the backslash: this is a plain `U`
  = note: the file compiles, and Rime cannot tell whether the backslash was meant to be part of the string
  = help: write `\\U` to keep the backslash, or `U` alone to say what Luau reads

error[R0611] (conservative): `\.` is not an escape sequence
--> 12:41: Luau drops the backslash: this is a plain `.`
  = note: the file compiles, and Rime cannot tell whether the backslash was meant to be part of the string
  = help: write `\\.` to keep the backslash, or `.` alone to say what Luau reads
  = help: if this string is a pattern, its escape character is `%`: `%.`

error[R0611] (conservative): `\d` is not an escape sequence
--> 14:37: Luau drops the backslash: this is a plain `d`
  = note: the file compiles, and Rime cannot tell whether the backslash was meant to be part of the string
  = help: write `\\d` to keep the backslash, or `d` alone to say what Luau reads
  = help: if this string is a pattern, its escape character is `%`: `%d`
